Starting TIFF Channel Merger...

This version includes:
- FIXED: No more crashes with 4+ large images!
- Uses tiffload --unlimited to bypass 50MB TIFF limit
- Intermediate processing in .v format (no memory constraints)
- Converts to pyramidal TIFF only at the final step
- Optimized for large TIFF files with minimal RAM usage
- Channel naming feature for QuPath integration

=== Using VIPS with unlimited memory mode ===
Method: tiffload --unlimited --access sequential + .v temp format
Step 1: Load each TIFF with unlimited memory to .v format
Step 2: Merge .v files (no limits)
Step 3: Convert merged .v to pyramidal TIFF (no reload limits)
